A suprising but interesting combination is a ring of conflict combined
with
a wand of create monster (which usually have zillions of charges :)
When a single monster is bashing away at you and you are wearing a ring
of conflict, zap the create monster wand and watch them attack each other
and then run for life!

You must be careful with a ring of conflict in a shop, your pet might be
in danger.

But the shopkeeper can be a wonderful friend when any nasties try to
enter a shop
when you are wearing your ring of conflict.

It is a sight to behold when you walk into a large opulent throne room :-)

But the bottom line is: you don't get experience points for watching
monsters
bash each other to death, so rings of conflict can lull you into a false
sense of
security.

